ur quarters to 2026-10-31 revenue added up to $5.7 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to -$50.8 million and net income to $117 million.","cites":["CRWD.d.revenue.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","CRWD.d.revenue.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","CRWD.d.revenue.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","CRWD.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","CRWD.d.revenue.2026-08-01.2026-10-31","CRWD.d.opinc.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","CRWD.d.opinc.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","CRWD.d.opinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","CRWD.d.opinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","CRWD.d.opinc.2026-08-01.2026-10-31","CRWD.d.netinc.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","CRWD.d.netinc.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","CRWD.d.netinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","CRWD.d.netinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","CRWD.d.netinc.2026-08-01.2026-10-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $1.8 billion: operating cash flow of $2.3 billion less capital spending of $487 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["CRWD.d.ocf.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","CRWD.d.ocf.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","CRWD.d.ocf.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","CRWD.d.ocf.2026-02-01.2026-07-31","CRWD.d.ocf.2026-02-01.2026-10-31","CRWD.d.capex.2025-02-01.2026-01-31","CRWD.d.capex.2025-02-01.2025-10-31","CRWD.d.capex.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","CRWD.d.capex.2026-02-01.2026-07-31","CRWD.d.capex.2026-02-01.2026-10-31"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $9 billion at the end of FY2026, against $6.5 billion a year earlier. That is 187% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["CRWD.rpo.2026","CRWD.rpo.2025","CRWD.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $4.8 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $3.7 billion a year earlier.","cites":["CRWD.deferred.2026","CRWD.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 10,698 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $450,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["CRWD.q.employees","CRWD.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $44.8 million.","cites":["CRWD.restructuring.2026"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $5.2 billion in cash and cash equivalents, and $745 million of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent). Cash exceeded that debt by $4.5 billion (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["CRWD.cash.2026","CRWD.debtLong.2026"]}]},"fin":{"CRWD":{}},"quotes":{"CRWD.q.employees":{"c":"CRWD","kind":"employees","n":10698,"quote":"As of January 31, 2026, we had 10,698 full-time employees.","source":"CRWD-0001535527-26-000010","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-03-05","proof":"0dfe35de24da4465dd1aa94e2324222ba26c179f1c9bdf1b014adee64c479993"}}}